  "description": "XOYQUY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H88 Eu8 N12 O48 4+,4(Cl1 O4 1-),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2B (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.772-3.911 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.55-109.32°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H94Cl4Eu8N12O67. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
